%% Lecturer Grades and Publishes Results
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Lecturer
    actor Student
    participant LecturerUI as Lecturer React UI
    participant StudentUI as Student React UI
    participant API as Express API
    participant Auth as Lecturer Authorization
    participant Service as Grading Service
    participant ExamService as Exam Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Lecturer->>LecturerUI: Open exam submissions
    LecturerUI->>API: GET /api/exams/:examId/submissions + JWT
    API->>Auth: Verify JWT, role, and exam ownership
    Auth-->>API: Authorized request
    API->>Service: getExamSubmissions(examId)
    Service->>DB: SELECT submitted attempts
    DB-->>Service: Submission list
    Service-->>LecturerUI: Submissions JSON
    LecturerUI-->>Lecturer: Display submissions

    Lecturer->>LecturerUI: Open one submission
    LecturerUI->>API: GET /api/submissions/:id
    API->>Auth: Verify grading permission
    API->>Service: getSubmissionForGrading(id)
    Service->>DB: SELECT submission, answers, and questions
    DB-->>Service: Grading data
    Service-->>LecturerUI: Submission details

    loop Grade each manual answer
        Lecturer->>LecturerUI: Enter score and feedback
        LecturerUI->>API: PATCH /api/answers/:answerId/grade
        API->>Auth: Verify grading permission
        API->>Service: gradeAnswer(answerId, score, feedback)
        Service->>DB: UPDATE answer score and feedback
        DB-->>Service: Updated answer
        Service-->>LecturerUI: Grade saved
    end

    Lecturer->>LecturerUI: Grade complete submission
    LecturerUI->>API: PATCH /api/submissions/:id/grade
    API->>Service: gradeSubmission(totalScore, feedback)
    Service->>DB: UPDATE submission status to GRADED
    Service->>DB: Save total score and feedback
    DB-->>Service: Graded submission
    Service-->>LecturerUI: Submission grade saved

    Lecturer->>LecturerUI: Publish exam results
    LecturerUI->>API: PATCH /api/exams/:id/publish-results
    API->>Auth: Verify exam ownership
    API->>ExamService: publishResults(examId)
    ExamService->>DB: UPDATE exam status to RESULTS_PUBLISHED
    DB-->>ExamService: Updated exam
    ExamService-->>LecturerUI: Results published

    Student->>StudentUI: Open result page
    StudentUI->>API: GET /api/submissions/:id/result + JWT
    API->>DB: Verify student ownership
    API->>DB: Verify results are published
    DB-->>API: Score, answers, and feedback
    API-->>StudentUI: Published result JSON
    StudentUI-->>Student: Display grade and feedback
